          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Set a Faction Indicator on the battlefield Within 8&quot; of this Unit. While Enemy Units are Within 2&quot; of this Faction Indicator they suffer DEBUFF Speed (2).</characteristic>
