        <profile name="Bound by the Khala" id="c675-1678-6232-e57f" hidden="false" typeId="a305-fb8b-8be3-f0fe" typeName="Rules (Any Phase)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">Use when the Current Supply Value of another Friendly Unit Within 8&quot; of this Unit is reduced. Return one Non-Unique Exhausted Tactical Card to the Ready state.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="1696-5ea7-559b-bb8b">Reaction (0 PE)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Warp-In" id="23e2-a6e7-f9e6-5cff" hidden="false" typeId="ec1d-63b8-de26-1894" typeName="Rules (Movement Phase)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Resolve the PLACE (6) effect.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e11e-d579-0142-8de4">Active (1 PE)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psionic Gale" id="5834-1162-51d0-2a09" hidden="false" typeId="ec1d-63b8-de26-1894" typeName="Rules (Movement Phase)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Set a Psionic Storm token Within 10&quot; and Line of Sight of this Unit. This token is not removed if this Unit is Destroyed. At the End of each Phase, set a Psionic Storm Blast Template on the centre of this token. For each Unit that has at least one model whose base is partially covered by the template, roll 3 dice, plus 1 additional die for each model in that Unit whose base is partially covered. For each result of 4+, that Unit suffers an effect depending on the current Phase:
Movement Phase: NON-LETHAL DAMAGE (1).
Assault Phase: 1 Damage.
If multiple effects trigger at the End of the Assault Phase, resolve them in the order specified in Part 8.9.4.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e11e-d579-0142-8de4">Active (2 PE)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feedback" id="8360-59a4-df5b-c5ff" hidden="false" typeId="ec1d-63b8-de26-1894" typeName="Rules (Movement Phase)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Target one Enemy Mechanical or Psionic Unit Within 8&quot;. Until the End of the Round, after that Unit resolves an Active or Reaction Special Ability (excluding abilities granted by a Tactical Card or Faction Card), it suffers NON-LETHAL DAMAGE (3).</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e11e-d579-0142-8de4">Active (1 PE)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psi Blast" id="9ec2-ac04-d38d-c6c6" hidden="false" typeId="e8b6-5b29-e80c-a3b3" typeName="Assault Weapon">
