              <profiles>
                <profile name="Psionic Storm" id="19bc-793f-033c-3881" hidden="false" typeId="ec1d-63b8-de26-1894" typeName="Rules (Movement Phase)">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Set a Psionic Storm token Within 10&quot; and Line of Sight of this Unit. This token is not removed if this Unit is Destroyed. At the End of each Phase, set a Psionic Storm Blast Template on the centre of this token. For each Unit that has at least one model whose base is partially covered by the template, roll 3 dice, plus 1 additional die for each model in that Unit whose base is partially covered. For each result of 5+, that Unit suffers an effect depending on the current Phase:
Movement Phase: NON-LETHAL DAMAGE (1).
Assault Phase: 1 Damage.
If multiple effects trigger at the End of the Assault Phase, resolve them in the order specified in Part 8.9.4.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e11e-d579-0142-8de4">Active (2 PE)</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
