                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Target one Friendly Unit Within 12&quot;. Until the End of the Round, that Unit is eligible to make an Evade Roll against any attacks targeting it.</characteristic>
