          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">Once per Round, when a Friendly Support Unit activates a Special Ability that costs PE, resolve that ability with its PE cost reduced by 1 (to a minimum of 0). Do not Exhaust this card.</characteristic>
